# Next.js rules

This project uses Next.js 16. Before writing or changing Next.js code, read
the relevant guide in `node_modules/next/dist/docs/`; APIs and conventions may
differ from earlier releases. Follow the existing App Router structure and
preserve the generated Next.js agent-rules block in `AGENTS.md`.

Do not add dependencies unless the active Spec requires them and the decision
is recorded in `Specs/decisions.md`.
